msgstr "Auto-Inhangen vun Reedschappen"

#. +> trunk
#: DeviceAutomounterKCM.cpp:48
msgid "Automatically mounts devices at login or when attached"
msgstr "Hangt Reedschappen bi't Insteken oder Anmellen automaatsch in"

#. +> trunk
